Package: finalproject
Title: Public Health Data for the BST260 Final Project
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Zihan",
           family = "Zhou",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zihanzhou@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: Provides public health datasets for the BST260 final project.
    Includes data on waterborne and foodborne illness events, firearm mortality,
    homicide rates, and firearm legislation. Provides documentation to support
    exploration and interpretation of these datasets.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/ChiantiZhou/finalproject,
    https://ChiantiZhou.github.io/finalproject/
BugReports: https://github.com/ChiantiZhou/finalproject/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
